# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVACY / PHI PROTECTION  (added for the 2026 practice-transition project)
# Never commit patient data, exports, credentials, or audit artifacts.
# Patient data lives OUTSIDE this repo in ../private_data and must stay there.
# These rules are belt-and-suspenders in case any such file lands inside repo/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Patient data / exports (any spreadsheet or delimited export = potential PHI)
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.tsv

# Project working/output folders (kept as siblings of repo/, never tracked)
private_data/
outputs/
vendor_exports/
audit_packet/
screenshots/

# Credentials & secrets
.env
.env.*
*.env
credentials*
*secret*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.gstack/
